      "body": "## Motivation\n\nThe gateway docs point at source locations that no longer exist:\n\n- `sgl_model_gateway.mdx` says the WASM examples are in `examples/wasm/` with `auth/`, `rate_limit/`, `logging/` subdirectories; they are in `sgl-model-gateway/examples/wasm/` as `wasm-guest-auth/`, `wasm-guest-ratelimit/`, `wasm-guest-logging/`.\n- `sgl-model-gateway/README.md` sends readers to `src/tokenizer`, `src/reasoning_parser` and `src/tool_parser`, which were replaced by the `llm-tokenizer`, `reasoning-parser` and `tool-parser` crates.\n- `classify_models.mdx` names `sgl-model-gateway/src/protocols/spec.rs`; the classify request/response types now come from the `openai-protocol` crate (re-exported as `crate::protocols`).\n\n## Modifications\n\nUpdate those three references. No behaviour change.\n\nNot addressed here: the WASM examples' `wit_bindgen` path `../../../src/wasm/interface` (and the matching sentence in `sgl_model_gateway.mdx`) has pointed at a removed directory since #17746, so the examples do not build. That needs the WIT location from the `smg-wasm` crate and a WASM build to verify, so it is left for a separate change.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nN/A (documentation only).\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nN/A (documentation only).\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format your code according to the [Format code with pre-commit](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#format-code-with-pre-commit).\n- [ ] Add unit tests according to the [Run and add unit tests](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#run-and-add-unit-tests). (N/A, docs only)\n- [x] Update documentation according to [Write documentations](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#write-documentations).\n- [ ] Provide accuracy and speed benchmark results according to [Test the accuracy](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#test-the-accuracy) and [Benchmark the speed](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#benchmark-the-speed). (N/A)\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style [guidance](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#code-style-guidance).\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:white_check_mark: [Run #39227360932](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39227360932)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #39227360948](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39227360948)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:heavy_minus_sign: **No AMD PR run found for this commit**.<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
