      "patch": "@@ -1577,7 +1577,7 @@ WASM middleware runs in a sandboxed environment with memory isolation, no networ\n \n ### Examples\n \n-Complete working examples are available in `examples/wasm/`:\n+Complete working examples are available in `sgl-model-gateway/examples/wasm/`:\n \n <table style={{width: \"100%\", borderCollapse: \"collapse\", tableLayout: \"fixed\"}}>\n   <colgroup>\n@@ -1592,15 +1592,15 @@ Complete working examples are available in `examples/wasm/`:\n   </thead>\n   <tbody>\n     <tr>\n-      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", fontWeight: 500, backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}>`auth/`</td>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", fontWeight: 500, backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}>`wasm-guest-auth/`</td>\n       <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\"}}>API key authentication for protected routes</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n-      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", fontWeight: 500, backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}>`rate_limit/`</td>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", fontWeight: 500, backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}>`wasm-guest-ratelimit/`</td>\n       <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\"}}>Per-client rate limiting (requests/minute)</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n-      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", fontWeight: 500, backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}>`logging/`</td>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", fontWeight: 500, backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}>`wasm-guest-logging/`</td>\n       <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\"}}>Request tracking headers and response modification</td>\n     </tr>\n   </tbody>",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/raw/9feed6c3e904faab4ed01061c0437e26a2806437/docs%2Fdocs%2Fadvanced_features%2Fsgl_model_gateway.mdx",
