      "deletions": 1,
      "filename": "docs/docs/supported-models/classify_models.mdx",
      "patch": "@@ -146,7 +146,7 @@ Error response format:\n \n The classification API is implemented using:\n \n-1. **Rust Model Gateway**: Handles routing and request/response models in `sgl-model-gateway/src/protocols/spec.rs`\n+1. **Rust Model Gateway**: Handles routing; the request/response models (`ClassifyRequest`, `ClassifyResponse`) come from the `openai-protocol` crate\n 2. **Python HTTP Server**: Implements the actual endpoint in `python/sglang/srt/entrypoints/http_server.py`\n 3. **Classification Service**: Handles the classification logic in `python/sglang/srt/entrypoints/openai/serving_classify.py`\n ",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/raw/9feed6c3e904faab4ed01061c0437e26a2806437/docs%2Fdocs%2Fsupported-models%2Fclassify_models.mdx",
      "sha": "18448563b82330b4a935450ea4844deb6270bf43",
      "status": "modified"
    },
    {
      "additions": 2,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/9feed6c3e904faab4ed01061c0437e26a2806437/sgl-model-gateway%2FREADME.md",
      "changes": 4,
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sgl-project/sglang/contents/sgl-model-gateway%2FREADME.md?ref=9feed6c3e904faab4ed01061c0437e26a2806437",
      "deletions": 2,
      "filename": "sgl-model-gateway/README.md",
      "patch": "@@ -460,8 +460,8 @@ The HTTP router exposes the full OpenAI-compatible surface area (`/generate`, `/\n - Provides the same `/v1/*` APIs as the HTTP router while streaming tokenized requests/responses directly to SRT gRPC workers.\n - Built-in reasoning parsers for DeepSeek, Qwen, Llama, Mistral, GPT-OSS, Step-3, GLM4, GLM4.7, Kimi K2, and other structured-thought models.\n - Tool-call parsers for JSON, Pythonic, XML, and custom schemas with streaming and non-streaming execution loops.\n-- Tokenizer factory supporting HuggingFace models, local tokenizer.json files, and chat template overrides (see `src/tokenizer`).\n-- Explore the code paths in `src/reasoning_parser`, `src/tool_parser`, and `src/tokenizer` for the end-to-end Rust implementations that power gRPC mode.\n+- Tokenizer factory supporting HuggingFace models, local tokenizer.json files, and chat template overrides (the `llm-tokenizer` crate).\n+- The end-to-end Rust implementations that power gRPC mode come from the `reasoning-parser`, `tool-parser`, and `llm-tokenizer` crates (see `Cargo.toml`).\n \n ### OpenAI Router\n - Proxies OpenAI-compatible chat completions and responses APIs, preserving headers and SSE streams end-to-end.",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/raw/9feed6c3e904faab4ed01061c0437e26a2806437/sgl-model-gateway%2FREADME.md",
      "sha": "dafbe2e4d85ef4010f292ee430d18b8541903689",
